ense#28-orden-de-implementación","content":"Orden de implementación"},"944":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/guias/arquitectura-tower-defense-41","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/guias/arquitectura-tower-defense","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/red/v1/guias/arquitectura-tower-defense#29-criterio-para-saber-si-la-arquitectura-está-funcionando","content":"Criterio para saber si la arquitectura está funcionando"},"945":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/guias/arquitectura-tower-defense-42","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/guias/arquitectura-tower-defense","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/red/v1/guias/arquitectura-tower-defense#30-resumen-de-la-arquitectura","content":"Resumen de la arquitectura"},"946":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/guias/arquitectura-tower-defense-43","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/guias/arquitectura-tower-defense","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/guias/arquitectura-tower-defense","content":"Esta guía no enseña a programar una implementación concreta. Define cómo repartir responsabilidades entre cliente, servidor, Eco y gameplay para construir un Tower Defense 3D real de hasta cuatro jugadores."},"947":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/guias/arquitectura-tower-defense-44","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/guias/arquitectura-tower-defense","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/guias/arquitectura-tower-defense#la-decisión-principal","content":"La arquitectura recomendada es **servidor autoritativo con clientes predictivos sólo donde aporte valor visual**."},"948":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/guias/arquitectura-tower-defense-45","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/guias/arquitectura-tower-defense","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/guias/arquitectura-tower-defense#la-decisión-principal","content":"El cliente expresa intención: seleccionar, construir, mejorar, vender, mover una unidad controlable o activar una habilidad. El servidor valida la intención, modifica el estado real de la partida y Eco distribuye ese estado a los jugadores correspondientes."},"949":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/guias/arquitectura-tower-defense-46","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/guias/arquitectura-tower-defense","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/guias/arquitectura-tower-defense#la-decisión-principal","content":"No conviene utilizar Eco como un simple sistema para replicar cada `Transform`. Eco debe transportar el estado y las decisiones que necesitan autoridad de red; el cliente debe encargarse de presentar ese estado de forma fluida."},"950":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/guias/arquitectura-tower-defense-47","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/guias/arquitectura-tower-defense","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/guias/arquitectura-tower-defense#la-decisión-principal","content":"Si una decisión puede cambiar el resultado de la partida, el servidor debe poder reconstruirla y validarla sin confiar en el cliente."},"951":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/guias/arquitectura-tower-defense-48","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/guias/arquitectura-tower-defense","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/guias/arquitectura-tower-defense#1-arquitectura-completa","content":"Cada cliente contiene aproximadamente cuatro capas:"},"952":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/guias/arquitectura-tower-defense-49","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/guias/arquitectura-tower-defense","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/guias/arquitectura-tower-defense#1-arquitectura-completa","content":"Cámara, UI, animaciones, efectos, audio y feedback visual."},"953":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/guias/arquitectura-tower-defense-50","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/guias/arquitectura-tower-defense","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/guias/arquitectura-tower-defense#1-arquitectura-completa","content":"Acciones que el jugador solicita al servidor."},"954":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/guias/arquitectura-tower-defense-51","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/guias/arquitectura-tower-defense","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/guias/arquitectura-tower-defense#1-arquitectura-completa","content":"Objetos y componentes que representan el estado recibido."},"955":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/guias/arquitectura-tower-defense-52","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/guias/arquitectura-tower-defense","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/guias/arquitectura-tower-defense#1-arquitectura-completa","content":"Interpolación, suavizado y efectos que no necesitan autoridad."},"956":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/guias/arquitectura-tower-defense-53","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/guias/arquitectura-tower-defense","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/guias/arquitectura-tower-defense#2-qué-debe-ser-autoritativo","content":"El servidor debe poseer cualquier dato que pueda afectar al resultado de la partida."},"957":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/guias/arquitectura-tower-defense-54","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/guias/arquitectura-tower-defense","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/guias/arquitectura-tower-defense#2-qué-debe-ser-autoritativo","content":"Sistema"},"958":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/guias/arquitectura-tower-defense-55","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/guias/arquitectura-tower-defense","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/guias/arquitectura-tower-defense#2-qué-debe-ser-autoritativo","content":"Autoridad recomendada"},"959":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/guias/arquitectura-tower-defense-56","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/guias/arquitectura-tower-defense","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/guias/arquitectura-tower-defense#2-qué-debe-ser-autoritativo","content":"Motivo"},"960":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/guias/arquitectura-tower-defense-57","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/guias/arquitectura-tower-defense","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/guias/arquitectura-tower-defense#2-qué-debe-ser-autoritativo","content":"Economía"},"961":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/guias/arquitectura-tower-defense-58","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/guias/arquitectura-tower-defense","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/guias/arquitectura-tower-defense#2-qué-debe-ser-autoritativo","content":"Servidor"},"962":{"id":"/docs/red/v1/guias/arquitectura-tower-defense-59","page_id":"/docs/red/v1/guias/arquitectura-tower-defense","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/red/v1/guias/arquitectura-tower-defense#2-q